---
layout: base.njk
title: "Alternate Picking Deep Dive"
description: "A free step-by-step alternate picking course: how to hold the pick, find your picking motion, and drill the shapes across six, two, and single strings."
permalink: /alternate-picking/
ogType: website
---
<style>
  .course-start { display:inline-block; font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:1.05rem; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; background:var(--purple); color:var(--white); padding:16px 36px; border-radius:10px; text-decoration:none; transition:background .2s; }
  .course-start:hover { background:var(--purple-lt); }
  .course-toc { margin-top:8px; }
  .course-toc-sec { font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:.85rem; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--purple-lt); margin:40px 0 6px; }
  .course-toc-list { list-style:none; }
  .course-toc-item { border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); }
  .course-toc-item a { display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:18px; padding:20px 4px; text-decoration:none; transition:opacity .2s; }
  .course-toc-item a:hover { opacity:.9; }
  .course-toc-num { font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:1rem; letter-spacing:.05em; color:var(--dim); min-width:28px; }
  .course-toc-text { flex:1; min-width:0; }
  .course-toc-title { display:block; font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:1.3rem; letter-spacing:.01em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--white); line-height:1.2; }
  .course-toc-sum { display:block; font-family:'Lato',sans-serif; font-size:1.02rem; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.5; margin-top:5px; }
  .course-toc-dur { font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif; font-size:.85rem; letter-spacing:.08em; color:var(--dim); white-space:nowrap; }
</style>
<header class="notes-header">
  <span class="essay-eyebrow">Free Course</span>
  <h1>Alternate Picking Deep Dive</h1>
  <p>Here's a 30-minute daily practice routine that will set you up right when it comes to alternate picking, to have a solid ground to build on. I go through crucial practice techniques in this routine, so make sure you watch the videos to get the most out of this.</p>
  {% if collections.picking | length %}
  <p style="margin-top:28px;"><a class="course-start" href="{{ collections.picking[0].url }}">Start the course &#8594;</a></p>
  {% endif %}
</header>
<div class="course-toc">
  {% for sec in collections.pickingSections %}
  <div class="course-toc-sec">{{ sec.name }}</div>
  <ul class="course-toc-list">
    {% for l in sec.lessons %}
    <li class="course-toc-item">
      <a href="{{ l.url }}">
        <span class="course-toc-num">{{ l.data.order }}</span>
        <span class="course-toc-text">
          <span class="course-toc-title">{{ l.data.title }}</span>
          {% if l.data.summary %}<span class="course-toc-sum">{{ l.data.summary }}</span>{% endif %}
        </span>
        {% if l.data.duration %}<span class="course-toc-dur">{{ l.data.duration }}</span>{% endif %}
      </a>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% set plMode = "full" %}{% include "practice-log.njk" %}

<style>
  .ask-block { margin-top:64px; border:1px solid var(--border); background:var(--card); border-radius:12px; padding:36px 32px; }
  .ask-block h3 { font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:1.5rem; letter-spacing:.03em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--white); margin:0 0 10px; }
  .ask-block > p { color:var(--muted); font-size:1.08rem; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 24px; }
  .ask-field { margin-bottom:18px; }
  .ask-field label { display:block; font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:.85rem; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--white); margin-bottom:8px; }
  .ask-field input, .ask-field textarea { width:100%; box-sizing:border-box; background:var(--bg, #0e0a1f); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:10px; padding:13px 15px; color:var(--white); font-family:'Lato',sans-serif; font-size:1.02rem; line-height:1.5; transition:border-color .2s; }
  .ask-field input:focus, .ask-field textarea:focus { outline:none; border-color:var(--purple-lt); }
  .ask-field textarea { min-height:120px; resize:vertical; }
  .ask-consent { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:10px; margin-bottom:22px; }
  .ask-consent input { width:18px; height:18px; margin-top:3px; accent-color:var(--purple); flex:none; }
  .ask-consent label { color:var(--muted); font-size:.95rem; line-height:1.5; }
  .ask-submit { font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:1rem; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; background:var(--purple); color:var(--white); border:0; padding:15px 34px; border-radius:10px; cursor:pointer; transition:background .2s; }
  .ask-submit:hover { background:var(--purple-lt); }
  .ask-submit:disabled { opacity:.6; cursor:default; }
  .ask-success-inline h3 { font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:1.5rem; letter-spacing:.03em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--white); margin:0 0 10px; }
  .ask-success-inline p { color:var(--muted); font-size:1.08rem; line-height:1.6; margin:0; }
  .ask-hp { position:absolute; left:-9999px; }
</style>
<div class="ask-block">
  <h3>Stuck on something? Get my personal help.</h3>
  <p>Working through the course and something isn't clicking? Tell me where you're stuck. I read every message myself and reply personally with a concrete next step. Free, no catch.</p>
  <form name="ask-jon" id="askForm" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
    <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="ask-jon">
    <input type="hidden" name="ref" value="alternate-picking">
    <p class="ask-hp"><label>Leave this field empty: <input name="bot-field"></label></p>
    <div class="ask-field">
      <label for="ask-name">Name</label>
      <input id="ask-name" type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name">
    </div>
    <div class="ask-field">
      <label for="ask-email">Email</label>
      <input id="ask-email" type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email">
    </div>
    <div class="ask-field">
      <label for="ask-question">What are you stuck on?</label>
      <textarea id="ask-question" name="question" required placeholder="E.g. my pick keeps getting caught on the strings, I can't get past 100 bpm on part 3..."></textarea>
    </div>
    <div class="ask-consent">
      <input id="ask-newsletter" type="checkbox" name="newsletter" value="yes">
      <label for="ask-newsletter">Also send me your practice tips by email. Free lessons and licks, unsubscribe anytime.</label>
    </div>
    <button class="ask-submit" type="submit">Send It to Jon</button>
  </form>
  <div class="ask-success-inline" id="askSuccess" hidden>
    <h3>Got it!</h3>
    <p>Thanks for writing. I read every message myself and I'll reply personally, usually within a couple of days. Keep going with the course in the meantime.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
(function(){
  var form = document.getElementById('askForm');
  if (!form) return;
  form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
    e.preventDefault();
    var btn = form.querySelector('.ask-submit');
    if (btn) { btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = 'Sending...'; }
    var body = new URLSearchParams(new FormData(form)).toString();
    fetch('/', { method:'POST', headers:{'Content-Type':'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'}, body: body })
      .then(function(r){
        if (!r.ok) throw new Error();
        form.style.display = 'none';
        var ok = document.getElementById('askSuccess');
        ok.hidden = false;
        ok.scrollIntoView({ behavior:'smooth', block:'center' });
      })
      .catch(function(){
        if (btn) { btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = 'Send It to Jon'; }
        alert('Sorry, something went wrong sending your message. Please email jon@jonbjorkmusic.com directly.');
      });
  });
})();
</script>

<div class="essay-cta" style="margin-top:64px;">
  <h3>Go further with Practice Room Pro</h3>
  <p>When you are ready for the full system: the complete lesson library, weekly live Q&amp;A, and my input on your playing.</p>
  <a href="https://www.jonbjorkmusic.com/pro?ref=picking">Join Practice Room Pro</a>
</div>
